    # v386 (05/10/2026) -- THE VERB SELECTS (the typing of the Verb: the Name is the post); branch B of the ringdown REOPENED BY PREREGISTRATION (V1 by hash);
    # the erratum BESIDE R6; the quantum pillar reused from v385 by key (stated). The operator's words are VERBATIM in Portuguese, with the translation marked
    # «translated, condensed»; «…» marks every cut; the readings are [INPUT/ONTO]; the stone is [KERNEL]; proved is never confirmation (the ruler); the gate does not move.
    _vb6 = core.get("the_verb_v386") or {}
    _rb6 = core.get("ramo_b_preregistration_v386") or {}
    _le6 = core.get("ledger_errata_v386") or {}
    _qr6 = core.get("quantum_pillar_reuse_v386") or {}
    _rp6 = core.get("quantum_pillar_reproducibility_v385") or {}
    _tt6 = lambda x_: str(x_).replace("_", r"\_")

    def _tx6(x_):
        t_ = str(x_)
        for a_, b_ in (("\\", r"\textbackslash{}"), ("_", r"\_"), ("%", r"\%"), ("&", r"\&"), ("#", r"\#"), ("$", r"\$"), ("{", r"\{"), ("}", r"\}"), ("~", r"\~{}"), ("^", r"\^{}")):
            t_ = t_.replace(a_, b_)
        return t_

    def _n6(x_, nd_=2):
        if not isinstance(x_, (int, float)) or isinstance(x_, bool) or x_ != x_:
            return r"\text{n/a}"
        return "%%.%df" % nd_ % float(x_)
    _ok6 = _vb6.get("all_verified") is True
    _rok6 = _rb6.get("all_verified") is True and _rb6.get("read_ok") is True
    _pins6 = _rb6.get("pins") or {}
    _pv6 = lambda k_: (_pins6.get(k_) or {}).get("read")
    s.append(r"\section*{Beside (v386): the Verb selects; branch B reopened by preregistration}")
    s.append(r"\textbf{The Verb selects.} On 05/10/2026 the operator closed the typing of the Verb (verbatim, Portuguese): ``Verbo=seleção da ação'' (translated: Verb = selection of the action); ``O Verbo seleciona: nome, tempo e verdade'' (translated: the Verb selects: name, time and truth); ``O verbo é o operador de seleção da ação. E a ação selecionada é o objeto que será lido.'' (translated: the verb is the operator of selection of the action; the selected action is the object that will be read); ``O verbo não descreve a ação; ele a escolhe. É um operador de projeção'' (translated: the verb does not describe the action; it chooses it; it is a projection operator) --- $\mathcal V=|a\rangle\langle a|$ ---; and the circuit command $\to$ verb $\to$ action $\to$ object $\to$ reading $\to$ axiom. "
             r"And the Name: ``o Nome não é ontologia, o nome é `posto', é justamente `o posto', o local, como já falamos, onde a inscrição pode habitar com objeto distinto definido'' (translated, condensed: the Name is not ontology; the name is \emph{posto} --- the post --- the place where the inscription can dwell with a distinct, defined object); ``todo `nome' atribuído a um objeto é o destaque da tríade habitando o canal realizando a observação da preservação da identidade ômega sob um aspecto de posto absoluto'' (translated, condensed: every name attributed to an object is the highlight of the triad inhabiting the channel, realizing the observation of the preservation of the omega identity under an aspect of absolute post). "
             r"The stone \texttt{TheVerbSelectsTheAction} (93 declarations \textsf{[KERNEL]}, axioms within the trio, no \texttt{sorry}) proves what is mathematics in this, each part under its own name: \texttt{post a} is the POST --- the orthogonal projection onto $\mathbb C\cdot a$ (the same term as \texttt{PFmic} with $a=\Omega$), idempotent, self-adjoint, fixing its own action; \texttt{select a $\psi$ = post a $\psi$} is the Verb in act (to select is to land the inscription on the post); \texttt{verb} stays reserved to the gesture $\mathbb V_t$, which already exists in the kernel (\texttt{TGL.VerbInhabitant}) and is not redefined. "
             r"The reading $\langle\psi,P\psi\rangle=\|P\psi\|^2$ is a WEIGHT in $[0,1]$ (the Born rule \textsf{[KNOWN]}, proved in the finite/Hilbert setting); order matters (a concrete $2\times2$ witness: $[P_a,P_b]\neq0$); the triad $[V_i,V_j]=i\,c\,\varepsilon_{ijk}V_k$ is $\mathfrak{su}(2)$ scaled by $c$, with $c$ a real VARIABLE --- $c=\beta_{\mathrm{TGL}}$ is the operator's \textsf{[INPUT]}, $\beta$ never literal; the sign ruler says $\beta_{\mathrm{TGL}}=\alpha\sqrt e$, never the square of $\alpha$ --- and it is the COMPACT regime: reading, not face (the rule of the two regimes: nothing here has a limit); the axis posts $\tfrac12(1+\sigma_k)$ are idempotent, Hermitian, and posts of distinct axes do NOT commute ($[\mathrm{post}_1,\mathrm{post}_3]\neq0$) --- ``Selecionar o nome defasa o tempo'' (translated: selecting the name dephases the time) is the \textsf{[INPUT/ONTO]} reading of that fact, and the witness of §3 is the pair of posts (axis 3, axis 1) of the triad. "
             r"The power of the post is constant ($P^{n+1}=P$: the ``verbo fossilizado'' --- the fossilized verb --- reads as a stationed dynamical state; the $\lim$ is evaluation); anchoring preserves and transmitting dephases (re-exports of the v385 flow); the reading of the posted One returns the One ($\langle\Omega,P\Omega\rangle=1$). The triad is NOT derived from the axiom nor from $\beta$: it is the simplest habitation of the commutation relations the operator wrote; the identification $V_{\mathrm{name}},V_{\mathrm{time}},V_{\mathrm{truth}}\leftrightarrow\sigma_1,\sigma_2,\sigma_3$ is naming, not a theorem.")
    s.append(r"\textbf{Truth and cost, two faces of one object.} The operator \textsf{[INPUT/ONTO]}: ``concordo com a sua leitura de separar a verdade do custo, mas veja, são as duas faces do mesmo o objeto, porque o custo é jussivo à verdade, ou seja, reconhecer a identidade de determinado espectro é anular a superposição de qualquer outro nome que possa ser atribuído àquele mesmo objeto'' (translated, condensed: I agree with separating truth from cost, but they are the two faces of the same object, because the cost is jussive to the truth: to recognize the identity of a given spectrum is to annul the superposition of any other name that could be attributed to that same object). "
             r"In the stone: $P+(1-P)=1$, $P(1-P)=0$ and $(1-P)P=0$ (\texttt{truth\_and\_cost\_are\_two\_faces}, beside the v385 terms \texttt{post\_mul\_compl}/\texttt{compl\_mul\_post}); $|\mathcal R|^2=\sin^2\theta$ and $|\mathcal T|^2+|\mathcal R|^2=1$ (re-exports of the angular regime; in the runtime, and only there, $\sin^2\theta_M=\beta$); and reading the truth annihilates the superposition: $\|\Omega\|=1$, $P\Omega=\Omega\Rightarrow\langle\Omega,P\Omega\rangle=1$ and $(1-P)\Omega=0$. Separated as attributes (two terms), inseparable as an object (one conjunction).")
    s.append(r"\textbf{Time read twice; light and gravity.} ``quanto ao tempo, sabe que é a minha maior dificuldade,  em todo o processo, o que é o tempo? o tempo como fluxo da relatividade modular não pode ser dual, ele precisa ser lido duas vezes como confirmação da interdepend6encia relacional'' … ``justamente por isso a constante da luz ao cubo, aí que ela entra, como fase de retorno, que seria a segunda leitura'' \textsf{[INPUT/ONTO]} (translated, condensed: time is my greatest difficulty; as the flow of modular relativity it cannot be dual, it must be read twice as confirmation of the relational interdependence; that is where the speed of light cubed enters, as the return phase, which would be the second reading). "
             r"The term the house already has for ``lido duas vezes'' (read twice): \texttt{time\_read\_twice\_confirms\_the\_post} (a re-export, under the new name, of \texttt{the\_post\_is\_the\_modular\_zero}, v385) --- what the lock flow $e^{-tH_{\min}}$ leaves fixed for every $t$ is exactly what the modular phase $\Delta^{it}$ leaves fixed for every $t$: the two readings of the same flow have the same fixed set, the post. $c^3$ and $\tau_\star=k\,GM/c^3$ do NOT enter the stone: they stay in the branch-B preregistration (below). "
             r"``a luz como setor escuro, condensado psionico, precede a gravidade, mas eles são indissociáveis'' (translated: light as the dark sector, the psionic condensate, precedes gravity, but they are inseparable): in the stone, $J^2=1$, $JKJ=-K$ and $K\neq0$ give $JK\neq0$ and $[J,K]\neq0$ --- they neither separate nor commute (\texttt{light\_and\_gravity\_are\_inseparable}; habitation on the paired space through \texttt{J\_squared\_is\_one} and \texttt{JKJ\_eq\_neg\_K}; the Pauli habitation as illustration). The precedence is one of READING (light as the dark sector is the psionic condensate, the modular zero) \textsf{[INPUT/ONTO]}; $\mathcal V_{\mathrm{grav}}=K$ is the management's reading, not a theorem.")
    s.append(r"\textbf{The Lagrangian; the delegation.} ``concordo plenamente quanto à lagrangiana'' (translated: I fully agree about the Lagrangian): the typed face is one --- Euler--Lagrange selects the Name (\texttt{action\_locks\_zero\_iff}); the operator's name (Verb today, Word in 04/2026) stays \textsf{[ONTO]} beside; $S=\int\mathcal L\,d^4x$ remains \textsf{[OPEN]}. "
             r"And ``o resto vc consegue responder tudo agroa'' (translated: the rest you can answer all now): items 6--17 of the management's list were decided BY DELEGATION with the proposed default, stated as such (the coinage remains the operator's; any item is corrected beside). "
             + ((r"In this run the kernel verified " + str(_vb6.get("kernel_flags_ok")) + r" of " + str(_vb6.get("kernel_flags_total")) + r" declarations (" + str(_vb6.get("vrb_total")) + r" of the stone and " + str(_vb6.get("ang_total")) + r" of the angular wiring --- the angular regime, the two folds, the selector that can refuse, $|\mathcal R|^2=\sin^2\theta$, the name above every name, terminality, the gesture $\mathbb V_t$ and the tensor, compiled before and now on the ladder), the proposed token was read from the kernel itself and the operator's verbatim texts were checked by sha256: ")
                if _ok6 else (r"\textbf{In this run the stone did not seal} (" + str(_vb6.get("kernel_flags_ok", "n/a")) + r" of " + str(_vb6.get("kernel_flags_total", "n/a")) + r" declarations verified; token " + ("equal" if _vb6.get("token_matches_kernel") else "different") + r"; verbatim texts " + ("checked" if _vb6.get("verbatim_hashes_ok") else "NOT checked") + r"): "))
             + r"the gate does not change.")
    s.append(r"\begin{center}\small\texttt{" + _tt6((_vb6.get("token_from_kernel") if _ok6 else _vb6.get("token")) or "VERB_TYPING_STONE_NAME__ABSENT") + r"}\end{center}")
    s.append(r"\textbf{Branch B reopened by preregistration; the erratum beside R6.} ``eu não havia proibido o ramo B, acontece que naquela ocasião ainda não tínhamos todos os críterios para prosseguir'' … ``faz sentido examinar se a constante de acoplamento de fato emerge da relação do tempo emparelhado à gravidade sobre a constante da luz ao cubo'' … ``desde antes sustentei que o regime gravitônico é o da constante da luz ao cubo'' (the operator, 05/10/2026, 17:11:36 UTC; translated, condensed: I had not forbidden branch B --- at that time we did not yet have all the criteria; it makes sense to examine whether the coupling constant does emerge from the relation of time paired to gravity over the speed of light cubed; I have held since before that the gravitonic regime is that of the speed of light cubed). "
             r"\textbf{Erratum beside}: in the v383 ledger of charges (which stays intact as record) the reading R6 said ``o ramo B segue ENCERRADO'' (branch B remains closed); it becomes REOPENED BY PREREGISTRATION. The key of 02/10 is not revoked (on the face the cost reads as the complement); $\tau_\star=k\,GM/c^3$ is ANOTHER LAW, with its own channel in the ledger (F2b, face), not another side of F2; F2 (correspondence with GR, $\tau_\star=t_{\rm Planck}$) and R2 (propagation) stay as they are. "
             r"The branch-B preregistration V1 (\texttt{PREREG\_RAMO\_B\_RINGDOWN\_20261005\_V1}, on the Bench) was fixed BEFORE any data, with decisions 7--13 by delegation: $k=2\pi/\hat\kappa(\chi_f)$ (the KMS/modular period of the horizon: $8\pi$ at $\chi_f=0$ \textsf{[KNOWN]}; Kerr \textsf{[CONJECTURE]}; one $k$ only, the others as comparison columns), $M=M_f$ in the detector clock ($(1+z)$ cancels), SOURCE (propagation stays with R2), ENVELOPE as primary ($\delta\hat\tau_{220}=-x/(1+x)$, $x=\beta\,k\,N(\chi_f)$; phase diffusion as secondary with its own injection), ONLY set D (O4, blind) tests; A/B/C are NOT\_BLIND calibration; $\beta_{\rm read}$ is a declared output with $\sigma$ stated beforehand. "
             + ((r"In this run V1 was read by hash (JSON sha256/16 \texttt{" + _tt6(str((_rb6.get("sha256_read") or {}).get("json") or "")[:16]) + r"}; MD \texttt{" + _tt6(str((_rb6.get("sha256_read") or {}).get("md") or "")[:16]) + r"}; the recomputed \texttt{spec\_sha256} matches; every entry of the hash file matches on disk; the V1 $\beta$ (from the literal CODATA by regex) and the rite's $\beta$ (from the identity engine) agree to $" + _n6(abs(((_rb6.get("beta") or {}).get("rel_diff") or 0.0)) * 1e13, 1) + r"\times10^{-13}$ relative, within the house rule of $10^{-9}$): set D with " + str(_rb6.get("conjunto_D_n")) + r" eligible events (" + str(_pv6("conjunto_D_sem_hold")) + r" without a quality hold); exact power of the hypothesis on set A (31 events, NOT\_BLIND calibration) $" + _n6(_pv6("poder_exato_A31")) + r"\sigma$, on B (10) $" + _n6(_pv6("poder_exato_B10")) + r"\sigma$, on GW250114 $" + _n6(_pv6("poder_exato_C")) + r"\sigma$, under phase diffusion $" + _n6(_pv6("poder_x0p273")) + r"\sigma$ (numbers TRANSCRIBED from V1, not recomputed); $\sigma(\beta_{\rm read})/\beta=" + _n6(_pv6("sigma_beta_lido_sobre_beta_A31"), 3) + r"$ under the hypothesis; the power on D is born in the PE (v387). Admissible verdicts, in order: AWAITING\_DATA $\to$ INCONCLUSIVE\_SYSTEMATICS $\to$ NOT\_FALSIFIED\_UNDERPOWERED $\to$ FALSIFIED\_AT\_5SIGMA (of the pair $k,M,$identification) $\to$ NOT\_FALSIFIED\_POWERED; the word of confirmation is forbidden (NOT\_FALSIFIED is never a confirmation). NOTHING was opened: no central value in the spec nor from set D (the two central values of A/C, NOT\_BLIND calibration, are transcribed from the sealed v385 registry), no PE; the state is AWAITING\_DATA and the charge F2b passes from AWAITING\_PREREGISTRATION to AWAITING. ")
                if _rok6 else (r"\textbf{In this run V1 was NOT read by hash} (" + _tx6(str(_rb6.get("verdict") or "no record")) + r"); the charge F2b stays AWAITING\_PREREGISTRATION and this is stated. "))
             + r"What branch B does NOT decide: the gate, H2/H3, $\beta$ (the matrix rule; $\beta_{\rm read}$ does not feed back), the implication of QG and the correspondence with GR on the canonical branch; no NOT\_FALSIFIED reads as ``nature has decided''. The opening of set D is left to v387.")
    s.append(r"\textbf{The quantum pillar in this version.} The pillar is not the object of v386: "
             + ((r"it was REUSED from the sealed v385 run by the cache key (the \texttt{result.json} checked by sha256 against the sealed v385 one: " + ("matches" if _qr6.get("result_sha256_matches_v385_sealed") else r"\textbf{does not match}") + r"; the rederived verdict " + ("is the same" if _qr6.get("verdict_same_as_v385_sealed") else r"\textbf{differs}") + r"). ")
                if _qr6.get("reused") else ((r"reuse was refused (" + _tx6(str((_qr6.get("reuse_refused_detail") or "environment/engine/cache"))[:160]) + r") and the pillar was computed again; the verdict " + ("is the same as v385" if _qr6.get("verdict_same_as_v385_sealed") else r"\textbf{differs from v385}") + r". ")
                                            if _qr6.get("mode") == "COMPUTE" else r"neither reused nor computed in this run --- stated. "))
             + r"The sentence of the v385 section ``O pilar rodou de novo, inteiro'' (the pillar ran again, whole) describes the v385 run (record); the reproducibility measured there (bit for bit, 393 fields) stays in the v385 core and seal, in custody. In this run the reproducibility record says: \texttt{" + _tt6(str(_rp6.get("verdict") or "ABSENT")) + r"}" + ((r" (" + _tx6(str(_rp6.get("why"))) + r" --- stated by the runtime, in Portuguese)") if _rp6.get("why") else "") + r". This is computation \textsf{[COMPUTED]}; it does not move the gate.")
    s.append(r"\begin{center}\small\texttt{" + _tt6(_vb6.get("verdict") or "TGL_THE_VERB_V386__ABSENT") + r"}\end{center}")
    s.append(r"\begin{center}\small\texttt{" + _tt6(_rb6.get("verdict") or "TGL_RAMO_B_PREREGISTERED_V386__ABSENT") + r"}\end{center}")
    s.append(r"\begin{center}\small\texttt{" + _tt6(_le6.get("verdict") or "TGL_LEDGER_ERRATA_V386__ABSENT") + r"}\end{center}")
